{"success": true, "data": {"id": 1007, "displayOrder": 1119, "titleKo": "29CM, 보이넥스트도어 ‘쁘넥도’ MD 리미티드 오더로 흥행몰이··· “발매 20분 만에 완판 기록”", "titleEn": "29CM, Boynextdoor's \"Pnextdoor\" MD limited order hits box office... \"Sold out in 20 minutes\"", "titleJa": "29CM、ボイネクストドア「プネクド」MDリミテッドオーダーで興行モール・・・「発売20分で完版記録」", "titleZh": "29CM，Boynextdoor 的《Pnextdoor》MD 限量版预售火爆……“20 分钟售罄”", "contentKo": "<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_content_0.jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>감도 깊은 취향 셀렉트샵 29CM(이십구센티미터)가 한정 발매한 보이그룹 보이넥스트도어 공식 캐릭터 ‘쁘넥도(BBNEXDO)’의 첫 머천다이즈(MD)가 전 품목 완판을 기록했다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>29CM는 지난 10일부터 23일까지 보이넥스트도어 멤버들을 상징하는 공식 캐릭터 ‘쁘넥도’ 머천다이즈를 29 리미티드 오더를 통해 온·오프라인 한정 수량으로 선보였다. ‘쁘넥도’는 쁘띠 보이넥스트도어의 줄임말로 멤버들이 직접 캐릭터 제작에 참여해 팬들의 소장 가치를 한층 높인 것이 특징이다. 인형 키링, 응원봉 커버, 쿠션, 담요, 텀블러 등 총 10종으로 구성됐다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>발매 전부터 팬덤 사이에서 화제를 모은 ‘쁘넥도 공식 머천다이즈’는 지난 10일 오전 11시 판매를 시작하자마자 준비한 물량이 20여 분 만에 모두 소진됐다. 같은 날 오후 8시 오픈한 2차 예약 발매도 일부 품목이 완판됐다. 특히 지난 1일부터 14일까지 2주간 29CM 앱 내 관련 검색량이 14만 건 이상을 기록해 팬들의 높은 관심을 입증했다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>서울 성수동에 있는 29CM 큐레이션 쇼룸 ‘이구성수’에서 오프라인 팝업스토어도 열흘간 진행됐다. 보이넥스트도어 국내·외 팬덤을 위한 다양한 포토존과 이벤트 참여 행사를 선보여 뜨거운 호응을 얻었다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>29CM 관계자는 “취미와 관심사에 지갑을 여는 디깅(digging) 소비자를 위해 엔터테인먼트 분야까지 29 리미티드 오더 협업 대상을 확대하며 좋은 반응을 얻고 있다”라며 “앞으로 29CM만의 감도와 시각으로 패션은 물론 홈·뷰티·테크 등 라이프스타일 전반에서 신규 고객과 기존 고객의 만족도를 높일 수 있는 콘텐츠를 확대할 계획”이라고 설명했다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_content_1.jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_content_2.jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure>", "contentEn": "<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb1513_6792527d413028bb390de981_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(2).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>The first merchandise (MD) of the boy group Boy Next Door's official character 'BBNEXDO', released in limited quantities by the sensitive taste select shop 29CM (twenty-nine centimeters), has sold out all items.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>From the 10th to the 23rd, 29CM presented a limited quantity of merchandise featuring the official character 'Pnekdo', which symbolizes the members of Boynextdoor, both online and offline through 29 Limited Order. 'Pnekdo' is an abbreviation for Petit Boynextdoor, and the members directly participated in creating the characters, which further increased the value of the collection for fans. It consists of a total of 10 items, including a doll keychain, a lightstick cover, a cushion, a blanket, and a tumbler.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>\"Pnekdo Official Merchandise,\" which garnered attention among the fandom even before its release, sold out within 20 minutes of going on sale at 11:00 AM on the 10th. Some items also sold out during the second round of pre-orders, which opened at 8:00 PM the same day. The 29CM app generated over 140,000 related searches over the two weeks from the 1st to the 14th, demonstrating the high level of interest among fans.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>An offline pop-up store also ran for ten days at the 29CM curation showroom \"Lee Gu-seong-su\" in Seongsu-dong, Seoul. The store received a enthusiastic response from Boynextdoor's domestic and international fandoms, featuring various photo zones and event participation opportunities.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>A 29CM representative explained, “We are receiving a good response by expanding the scope of our 29 Limited Order collaboration to the entertainment field for digging consumers who open their wallets for hobbies and interests.” They added, “Going forward, we plan to expand content that can increase the satisfaction of new and existing customers across the entire lifestyle spectrum, including fashion, home, beauty, and tech, with 29CM’s unique sensibility and perspective.”</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb1517_679252b397eb2c6ac25b376d_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(3).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb151a_679252785dd112ee9bb1c490_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(1).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure>", "contentJa": "<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb1513_6792527d413028bb390de981_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(2).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>感度深い好みセレクトショップ29CM（二十九センチメートル）が限定発売したボーイグループボーイネクストドア公式キャラクター「プネクド（BBNEXDO）」の初のマーチャンダイズ（MD）が全品目完売を記録した。 </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>29CMは去る10日から23日までボイネクストドアメンバーを象徴する公式キャラクター「プネクド」マーチャンダイズを29リミテッドオーダーを通じてオン・オフライン限定数量で披露した。 「プネクド」はプチボイネクストドアの略でメンバーたちが直接キャラクター制作に参加してファンの所蔵価値を一層高めたのが特徴だ。人形キーリング、応援棒カバー、クッション、毛布、タンブラーなど全10種で構成された。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>発売前からファンダムの間で話題を集めた「プネクド公式マーチャンダイズ」は去る10日午前11時販売を始めるやいなや準備した物量が20余分ぶりにすべて消耗した。同日午後8時オープンした2次予約発売も一部品目が完売された。特に去る1日から14日まで2週間29CMアプリ内関連検索量が14万件以上を記録してファンの高い関心を立証した。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>ソウル城水洞にある29CMキュレーションショールーム「イ・グソンス」でオフラインポップアップストアも10日間行われた。ボーイネクストドア国内・外のファンダムのための多様なフォトゾーンとイベント参加イベントを披露して熱い呼応を得た。 </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>29CM関係者は「趣味と関心事に財布を開くデギング(digging)消費者のためにエンターテインメント分野まで29リミテッドオーダーコラボレーション対象を拡大して良い反応を得ている」とし「今後29CMだけの感度と視覚でファッションはもちろんホーム・ビューティー・テックなどライフスタイル全般で顧客計画」と説明した。</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb1517_679252b397eb2c6ac25b376d_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(3).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb151a_679252785dd112ee9bb1c490_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(1).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure>", "contentZh": "<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb1513_6792527d413028bb390de981_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(2).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>由品味敏感的精选商店 29CM（二十九厘米）限量发售的男团 Boy Next Door 官方角色“BBNEXDO”的首款周边商品（MD）已全部售罄。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>从10日至23日，29CM通过29 Limited Order线上线下渠道推出了以Boynextdoor成员的官方角色“Pnekdo”为主题的限量周边商品。“Pnekdo”是Petit Boynextdoor的缩写，成员们亲自参与了角色设计，更增添了收藏价值。此次推出的周边商品共包含10款，包括玩偶钥匙扣、应援棒套、抱枕、毯子和水杯。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>“Pnekdo官方周边商品”在发售前就已引起粉丝的广泛关注，于10日上午11点开售，20分钟内便售罄。当晚8点开启的第二轮预售中，部分商品也再次售罄。29CM app在1日至14日的两周内，相关搜索量超过14万次，充分展现了粉丝们的热情。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Boynextdoor还在首尔圣水洞的29CM策展空间“李九圣洙”开设了为期十天的线下快闪店。这家快闪店受到了国内外Boynextdoor粉丝的热烈欢迎，店内设有各种拍照区和活动参与机会。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>29CM的一位代表解释说：“我们通过将29 Limited Order合作项目拓展到娱乐领域，吸引那些愿意为自己的爱好和兴趣慷慨解囊的消费者，获得了良好的市场反响。”他们补充道：“未来，我们将以29CM独特的视角和理念，拓展涵盖时尚、家居、美妆和科技等各个生活方式领域的内容，以提升新老客户的满意度。”</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb1517_679252b397eb2c6ac25b376d_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(3).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/679252cde2487e82bbcb151a_679252785dd112ee9bb1c490_%255B29CM%2520%25EC%2582%25AC%25EC%25A7%2584%25EC%259E%2590%25EB%25A3%258C%255D%2520%25EB%25B3%25B4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EB%2584%25A5%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%258A%25B8%25EB%258F%2584%25EC%2596%25B4%2520%2527%25EC%2581%2598%25EB%2584%25A5%25EB%258F%2584%2527%2520%25EA%25B3%25B5%25EC%258B%259D%2520%25EB%25A8%25B8%25EC%25B2%259C%25EB%258B%25A4%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%25A6%2588%2520%25EB%25B0%259C%25EB%25A7%25A4%2520%25ED%258C%259D%25EC%2597%2585%25EC%258A%25A4%25ED%2586%25A0%25EC%2596%25B4%25EA%25B0%2580%2520%25EC%2597%25B4%25EB%25A6%25B0%2520%25EC%2584%259C%25EC%259A%25B8%2520%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%25EB%258F%2599%252029CM%2520%25ED%2581%2590%25EB%25A0%2588%25EC%259D%25B4%25EC%2585%2598%2520%25EC%2587%25BC%25EB%25A3%25B8%2520%2527%25EC%259D%25B4%25EA%25B5%25AC%25EC%2584%25B1%25EC%2588%2598%2527%2520(1).jpeg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure>", "thumbnailUrl": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlKo": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlEn": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlJa": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_thumbnail.jpg", "thumbnailUrlZh": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/press_release_1007_thumbnail.jpg", "linkUrl": null, "linkTarget": null, "publishedAt": "2025-01-24T00:00:00.000Z", "date": "2025.01.24", "visibleKo": true, "visibleEn": false, "visibleJa": false, "visibleZh": false, "hashtagsKo": [], "hashtagsEn": [], "hashtagsJa": [], "hashtagsZh": []}}